  first | exact @GlobalTheory.Core.Rk.Seesaw.seesaw_fubini | exact GlobalTheory.Core.Rk.Seesaw.seesaw_fubini | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.Core.Rk.Seesaw.seesaw_fubini <;> assumption)
